{
  "displayName": "Org Agentic Observability",
  "description": "Cross-project Vertex Gemini token usage (metrics scope hub: __SCOPE_PROJECT_ID__). Native metrics only — no central log sink.",
  "labels": {},
  "mosaicLayout": {
    "columns": 48,
    "tiles": [
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 0,
        "height": 10,
        "width": 48,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Org view — scope & drill-down",
          "text": {
            "format": "MARKDOWN",
            "content": "**Metrics scope hub:** `__SCOPE_PROJECT_ID__`\n\n**Projects in scope:** __MONITORED_PROJECTS_SUMMARY__\n\nThis dashboard aggregates **native Vertex** `token_count` across all projects in the hub metrics scope. Per-agent charts, log panels, and gateway SQL widgets stay on **project dashboards** until a central log sink is added.\n\n**Project dashboards**\n__PROJECT_DRILLDOWN_LINKS__\n\nMetric: `aiplatform.googleapis.com/publisher/online_serving/token_count` · grouped by `resource.project_id`"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 10,
        "height": 18,
        "width": 48,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Total tokens by project (15 min)",
          "xyChart": {
            "chartOptions": {
              "mode": "COLOR"
            },
            "dataSets": [
              {
                "plotType": "STACKED_BAR",
                "targetAxis": "Y1",
                "timeSeriesQuery": {
                  "timeSeriesFilter": {
                    "filter": "metric.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/publisher/online_serving/token_count\" resource.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/PublisherModel\"",
                    "aggregation": {
                      "alignmentPeriod": "900s",
                      "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                      "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                      "groupByFields": [
                        "resource.project_id"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            ],
            "yAxis": {
              "label": "Tokens",
              "scale": "LINEAR"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 0,
        "yPos": 28,
        "height": 8,
        "width": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Total tokens — 7 days (all scoped projects)",
          "scorecard": {
            "timeSeriesQuery": {
              "timeSeriesFilter": {
                "filter": "metric.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/publisher/online_serving/token_count\" resource.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/PublisherModel\"",
                "aggregation": {
                  "alignmentPeriod": "604800s",
                  "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_DELTA",
                  "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM",
                  "groupByFields": []
                }
              },
              "outputFullDuration": true
            },
            "sparkChartView": {
              "sparkChartType": "SPARK_LINE"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "xPos": 16,
        "yPos": 28,
        "height": 8,
        "width": 16,
        "widget": {
          "title": "Input tokens — 7 days",
